 "comment": "The upper floor of the hanging cells under the chapel of Gruvhald (D-1333, D-1340, D-1354). The stair from the chapel ends in the guard room, whose chest holds the iron key. A corridor of cells runs east, rats walk it, and a pit waits in it. Jailers walk the hall south of the corridor, hounds hold the kennel, and a jailer and a hound hold the store. The locked door of the hall takes the iron key, and the stair behind it leads down (D-1343). The cells are night and dark, so each patrol sees 2 tiles (D-1063, D-1338).",
